---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const [cars, problems, bestPages] = await Promise.all([
  getCollection("cars"),
  getCollection("problems"),
  getCollection("best")
]);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Car Problems, Best Parts, and Maintenance Guides"
  description="Kreativ Auto helps drivers diagnose car problems, compare the best replacement parts, and find practical maintenance guidance."
>
  <section class="container-shell py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr]">
      <div class="surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <p class="eyebrow">Kreativ Auto</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-6xl">
          Straight answers for car problems, parts, and maintenance.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-steel">
          Kreativ Auto is built for drivers who want to understand what is wrong, what usually fixes it, and which parts are actually worth buying. No filler, no vague advice, and no pretending every problem needs the most expensive option.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a class="rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-accent" href="/cars/">
            Browse car hubs
          </a>
          <a class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink hover:border-accent hover:text-accent" href="/best/">
            Explore best parts
          </a>
          <a class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink hover:border-accent hover:text-accent" href="/brands/">
            Browse taxonomies
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="surface grid gap-5 p-8">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What You Will Find</p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
            <li>Car pages with common issues, maintenance notes, and useful parts</li>
            <li>Problem guides that break symptoms into likely causes and realistic fixes</li>
            <li>Best-parts pages that compare options without sounding like a catalog</li>
            <li>More tools and calculators as the site grows</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-center">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4">
            <p class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">{cars.length}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-steel">Cars</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4">
            <p class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">{problems.length}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-steel">Problems</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4">
            <p class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">{bestPages.length}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-steel">Best Picks</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-shell pb-8">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="surface p-6">
        <p class="eyebrow">Cars</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Car pages that stay useful</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
          Each car page is meant to help you quickly understand the weak spots, the service priorities, and where to go next.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="surface p-6">
        <p class="eyebrow">Problems</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Problem guides that get to the point</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
          If the car shakes, squeals, hums, clicks, or misfires, the goal is to help you narrow it down fast.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="surface p-6">
        <p class="eyebrow">Best Parts</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Parts guides with a clear opinion</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
          The parts pages are here to help you choose well, not to bury you in ten nearly identical options.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-shell pb-12">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a class="surface block p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/brands/">
        <p class="eyebrow">Taxonomy</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Brands</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">Browse by make if you want to stay inside one brand and compare patterns across models.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="surface block p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/models/">
        <p class="eyebrow">Taxonomy</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Models</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">Model pages pull together the problems, maintenance points, and parts that matter for one vehicle.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="surface block p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/categories/">
        <p class="eyebrow">Taxonomy</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Part Categories</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">Use category pages when you already know the part type and want the best options by vehicle.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
